graduate real-world success
vs matched non-graduates

evaluation calibration

difficulty

out-of-distribution robustness

cost efficiency

credential age

sample size
```

So:

> **The reputation of a school comes from how accurately its graduation certificate predicts real-world capability.**

That's powerful.

